PLACEHOLDER FOR ICON.PNG

Thunderstore requires an icon.png file (256x256 pixels).

To complete the package:
1. Create or obtain a 256x256 PNG image
2. Rename this file from "icon.png.PLACEHOLDER" to "icon.png"
3. Replace it with your actual icon image

Suggestions for icon:
- Bagpipes illustration
- Viking ship with musical notes
- Celtic/Norse themed design
- Use free icon sources like:
  - Flaticon.com
  - Icons8.com
  - Create your own in GIMP/Photoshop
  - Use AI image generation (DALL-E, Midjourney, etc.)

Required specifications:
- Format: PNG
- Size: 256x256 pixels
- No transparency issues
- Clear at small sizes (Thunderstore displays it small)
